# Frontend Conventions

## Stack
- React SPA with Vite.
- TanStack Router route files live in `src/routes/`.
- Jotai holds multi-server session state in `serversAtom` (`src/state/servers.ts`).
- HTTP uses axios + axios-auth-refresh with per-server clients from `getServerClient(serverUrl)`.
- SharedWorker (`src/workers/shared-refresh-worker.ts`) coordinates refresh deduplication across tabs.

## Key Constraints
- Import shared contracts only via `@contracts/*`.
- Use `getServerClient(serverUrl)` for API calls; avoid ad-hoc axios instances in UI components.
- Refresh strategy is reactive (401 interceptor), not proactive timer-based.
- SharedWorker must deduplicate in-flight refresh per `serverUrl` for concurrent tabs.
- E2E uses Playwright with tests in `apps/frontend/e2e/`.

